    "title": "Stockroom API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Java Spring Boot portfolio project by Bharath Gudla. Same-origin session authentication and CSRF protection. Registered workspaces persist in PostgreSQL; sample demos expire after two hours. INR prices, UTC trend dates."
